center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">29\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0016450000</span>16,450<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">0.25 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Archons%27_Trial\" title=\"The Archons&#39; Trial\">The Archons' Trial</a></b>, End chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Maximum_Charge_Tier\" title=\"Maximum Charge Tier\">Maximum Charge Tier</a>: V</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Force_Shot\" title=\"Force Shot\">Force Shot</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Impulse\" title=\"Impulse\">Impulse +150</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Impulse\" title=\"Impulse\">Impulse +150</a>:</b> Passive: +150 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Force, Untyped, Slashing, Piercing, and Bludgeoning <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sheltering\" title=\"Sheltering\"> Sheltering +30</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sheltering\" title=\"Sheltering\"> Sheltering +30</a>:</b> +30 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Immunity_to_Fear\" title=\"Immunity to Fear\">Immunity to Fear</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\