tance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Force VI<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Force VI: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 2d10 points of force damage per hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>It appears an intrepid Artificer once modified this piece of Armor into a Rune Arm; the ingenuity of House Cannith knows no bounds.</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Arm_of_the_Archons_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Arm_of_the_Archons_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"386\" height=\"316\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Arm_of_the_Archons.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"http